          "commands_changes": {}
        },
        {
          "id": 467139880,
          "type": "DiscussionNote",
          "body": "@crondaemon thanks for the reply. I want to point out that the individual scanner jobs would find results and report results in the Security Dashboard, but that would not cause the whole pipeline to fail. Here's an [example pipeline](https://gitlab.com/stkerr/simply-simple-notes/-/pipelines/208907274) that ran scans and results. Note how none of the jobs failed. Let me know if that helps!\n\nOn a different note, any idea why the `clang-10` job would have failed? Not sure why these changes would affect that job.",
          "author": {
            "id": 4376883,
            "username": "stkerr",
